          "kicker": "Funding gap",
          "heading": "Manager Lionel Danford seeks $70,000 for Fiji deaf rugby sevens tour",
          "body": "The Fiji men’s and women’s deaf rugby sevens teams require up to $70,000 to fund their upcoming World Deaf Rugby Sevens Championship campaign in Tokyo. Team manager Lionel Danford confirmed that a significant funding gap remains for daily expenses and training camps, stating, \"We are still looking for funds.\" As part of their build-up for the tournament starting later this month, both squads recently scrimmaged against Osea Kolinisau’s national sevens side to sharpen technical skills and provide deaf players an opportunity to impress national selectors."
