          "heading": "Victor Wembanyama joins Provence Rugby sessions to develop physical movement patterns",
          "body": "NBA star Victor Wembanyama utilised his recent summer break to sharpen his conditioning through an immersive stint with second-tier side Provence. The 7ft 4in forward participated in line-out drills, tackle-pad sessions, and passing exercises, reportedly seeking to improve his stability and movement patterns. Wembanyama, who previously toured China to study strength training, praised the squad’s internal camaraderie after his time with the club. Provence have made a strong start to their domestic season, remaining unbeaten through their opening five league fixtures."
