          "body": "Connacht suffered a 36-19 defeat to Glasgow in Friday's URC fixture, as the visitors were \"mauled to death\" at Scotstoun. The hosts secured four of their five tries from lineout mauls, leaving Connacht struggling to contain the set-piece power. Despite two tries from Josh Ioane, the visitors could not overcome the early deficit created by Glasgow’s forward control. The match also saw Bundee Aki involved in a late-game outburst as his side fell to a disappointing result on the road."
